      "summaryZh": "OpenAI 宣布，Nubank 创始人 David Vélez 和纽约梅隆银行首席执行官 Robin Vince 将加入 OpenAI 基金会及 OpenAI Group PBC 的董事会，为组织带来金融、科技和治理方面的全球领导力。",
      "summaryEn": "OpenAI announced that David Vélez, founder of Nubank, and Robin Vince, CEO of BNY Mellon, will join the boards of the OpenAI Foundation and OpenAI Group PBC, bringing global leadership in finance, technology, and governance.",
